{"id":"dfb238ddf618b68f","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-multitape-time-hierarchy.md","title":"Deterministic Time Hierarchy","display":"thm-deterministic-time-hierarchy — Deterministic Time Hierarchy","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-multitape-time-hierarchy","aliases":["73-thm-multitape-time-hierarchy","73-thm-deterministic-time-hierarchy"],"display":"thm-deterministic-time-hierarchy — Deterministic Time Hierarchy","depends_on":["[[73-df-multitape-time-bounds]]","[[73-df-exact-clock-construction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-multitape-time-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-multitape-time-hierarchy</span><span>73-thm-deterministic-time-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-deterministic-time-hierarchy — Deterministic Time Hierarchy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8658210215541698\" href=\"?note=8658210215541698\" title=\"73-df-multitape-time-bounds\">73-df-multitape-time-bounds</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4aece652594d9d3c\" href=\"?note=4aece652594d9d3c\" title=\"73-df-exact-clock-construction\">73-df-exact-clock-construction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{DTIME}\">\\(\\mathsf{DTIME}\\)</span> (deterministic multitape time classes, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8658210215541698\" href=\"?note=8658210215541698\" title=\"73-df-multitape-time-bounds\">73-df-multitape-time-bounds</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TimeConstructible}\">\\(\\operatorname{TimeConstructible}\\)</span> (exact clock constructibility, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4aece652594d9d3c\" href=\"?note=4aece652594d9d3c\" title=\"73-df-exact-clock-construction\">73-df-exact-clock-construction</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}time\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\forall t_1,t_2:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\Biggl[\n\\begin{array}{l}\n\\operatorname{TimeConstructible}(t_1)\n\\land\\operatorname{TimeConstructible}(t_2)\\\\\n{}\\land\\bigl(\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\forall n\\in\\{m\\in\\mathbb N:m\\ge n_0\\}\\;\\bigl(\nb\\,t_1(n)\\lceil\\log_2(t_1(n)+1)\\rceil\\leq a\\,t_2(n)\n\\bigr)\\bigr)\n\\end{array}\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathsf{DTIME}(t_1)\\subsetneq\\mathsf{DTIME}(t_2)\n\\Biggr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}time\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\forall t_1,t_2:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\Biggl[\n\\begin{array}{l}\n\\operatorname{TimeConstructible}(t_1)\n\\land\\operatorname{TimeConstructible}(t_2)\\\\\n{}\\land\\bigl(\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\forall n\\in\\{m\\in\\mathbb N:m\\ge n_0\\}\\;\\bigl(\nb\\,t_1(n)\\lceil\\log_2(t_1(n)+1)\\rceil\\leq a\\,t_2(n)\n\\bigr)\\bigr)\n\\end{array}\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathsf{DTIME}(t_1)\\subsetneq\\mathsf{DTIME}(t_2)\n\\Biggr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The quantified <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\">\\(a,b\\)</span> clause expands <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_1(n)\\log t_1(n)=o(t_2(n))\">\\(t_1(n)\\log t_1(n)=o(t_2(n))\\)</span> without leaving little-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"o\">\\(o\\)</span> as an undeclared relation.</li>\n<li>Clocked diagonalization against the effective enumeration of machines constructs a language decidable within <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O(t_2)\">\\(O(t_2)\\)</span> but not within <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O(t_1)\">\\(O(t_1)\\)</span>; the logarithmic factor pays for universal multitape simulation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-multitape-time-bounds","status":"resolved","id":"8658210215541698","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-multitape-time-bounds]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-exact-clock-construction","status":"resolved","id":"4aece652594d9d3c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-exact-clock-construction]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-multitape-time-bounds","status":"resolved","id":"8658210215541698","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{DTIME}$ (deterministic multitape time classes, see [[73-df-multitape-time-bounds]])","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-exact-clock-construction","status":"resolved","id":"4aece652594d9d3c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TimeConstructible}$ (exact clock constructibility, see [[73-df-exact-clock-construction]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{DTIME}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TimeConstructible}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}time\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\forall t_1,t_2:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{>0}\\;\\Biggl[\n\\begin{array}{l}\n\\operatorname{TimeConstructible}(t_1)\n\\land\\operatorname{TimeConstructible}(t_2)\\\\\n{}\\land\\bigl(\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\forall n\\in\\{m\\in\\mathbb N:m\\ge n_0\\}\\;\\bigl(\nb\\,t_1(n)\\lceil\\log_2(t_1(n)+1)\\rceil\\leq a\\,t_2(n)\n\\bigr)\\bigr)\n\\end{array}\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathsf{DTIME}(t_1)\\subsetneq\\mathsf{DTIME}(t_2)\n\\Biggr]","display":true},{"tex":"a,b","display":false},{"tex":"t_1(n)\\log t_1(n)=o(t_2(n))","display":false},{"tex":"o","display":false},{"tex":"O(t_2)","display":false},{"tex":"O(t_1)","display":false}],"bytes":1532,"backlinks":[{"id":"f083376270d496d8","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"bad42cfb663ef0f3","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["8658210215541698","4aece652594d9d3c"]}